  "name": "LTX 2.3 IC-LoRA — image + audio to video (auto-prompt)",
  "description": "Bring a character image to life with a voice clip. Upload an image and a reference audio (speech), describe the shot, and LTX 2.3 generates a talking video synced to the audio. An in-graph Gemma model rewrites your prompt into an LTX-optimized one (toggle \"Enhance prompt with AI\" off to use your text as-is).\n\nThis is the IC-LoRA / creative variant — it uses the distilled model and no identity LoRA, so it follows your prompt freely rather than locking to a real person's face.\n\nSet the duration to roughly match your audio clip.",
